    <string name="library_artists_album_artist_explainer">the artists section is built from the album
        artist tag and nothing else, so a track credited “band, orchestra, guest, guest” belongs to the
        band alone and the guests are not artists of their own. leave splitting on above: with this on
        it reaches only the album artist tag itself, for the files that list the guests there too. a
        track with no album artist tag still goes under its own credit. turns believing that tag on
        with it.</string>
